{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-latency-model","title":"Cost Latency Model","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"token-economics","title":"Token 经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model/token-economics","wordCount":2374,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-anatomy","title":"延迟解剖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model/latency-anatomy","wordCount":2221,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"measuring-and-budgeting","title":"度量与预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model/measuring-and-budgeting","wordCount":2173,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<p>在动手优化之前、先把成本与延迟的量纲建立起来：钱是怎么按 token 算出来的、时间花在请求链路的哪几段。本章从 token 经济学讲起、拆解输入输出价差、缓存与批处理折扣以及典型应用的成本构成；再解剖延迟、区分 TTFT 与 TPS、说明流式与尾延迟为什么改变判断；最后落到度量与预算——为每个功能定下成本上限与延迟目标、配好告警、降级与容量规划。度量先于优化：没有量纲与数据、一切优化都是盲飞。</p>\n"}